    "name": "Patient 001",
    "steam_appid": 3277410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u26a0\ufe0f WARNING: This is a psychological, fourth-wall-breaking horror experience. It interacts with your game files (yes, real files). If you're uncomfortable with real file changes or meta-horror storytelling, this game may not be for you.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this psychological horror game, you must escape a twisted asylum by fighting zombies and fixing things. As you delve deeper, the lines between the game and reality start to blur, and I am your only guide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange experiments are being conducted within a mental asylum, turning patients into nightmarish creatures. You, a police officer, are sent to uncover the truth. But as you investigate, you\u2019ll find that this journey might be your last, with horrors lurking in every shadow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intriguing Narrative</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a captivating story filled with twists that keep you guessing about reality until the end.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inventory Management</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited space means you must pick and choose wisely. Collect only what you need, sell or trade items, and craft ammo to survive and use ribbons to save progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277410/extras/91a0730b3d0442c3c1ddf5f35174fd36.poster.avif?t=1752041971\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277410/extras/91a0730b3d0442c3c1ddf5f35174fd36.webm?t=1752041971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277410/extras/91a0730b3d0442c3c1ddf5f35174fd36.mp4?t=1752041971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your weapon carefully, ammo is limited. Shoot only when you need to. headshots are recommended.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedurally Generated Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items, enemies, room access, clues, and passwords are procedurally generated, so you won\u2019t feel bored in my game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277410/extras/63cbe5e72e713188654337d1a0e0ef9f.poster.avif?t=1752041971\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277410/extras/63cbe5e72e713188654337d1a0e0ef9f.webm?t=1752041971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277410/extras/63cbe5e72e713188654337d1a0e0ef9f.mp4?t=1752041971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles to Solve</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think outside the box and uncover secrets hidden within the asylum. Solve clever puzzles to progress and survive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices Matter</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape the world around you, leading to multiple endings. Will your choices grant you freedom?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u26a0\ufe0f WARNING: This is a psychological, fourth-wall-breaking horror experience. It interacts with your game files (yes, real files). If you're uncomfortable with real file changes or meta-horror storytelling, this game may not be for you.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this psychological horror game, you must escape a twisted asylum by fighting zombies and fixing things. As you delve deeper, the lines between the game and reality start to blur, and I am your only guide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange experiments are being conducted within a mental asylum, turning patients into nightmarish creatures. You, a police officer, are sent to uncover the truth. But as you investigate, you\u2019ll find that this journey might be your last, with horrors lurking in every shadow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intriguing Narrative</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a captivating story filled with twists that keep you guessing about reality until the end.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inventory Management</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited space means you must pick and choose wisely. Collect only what you need, sell or trade items, and craft ammo to survive and use ribbons to save progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277410/extras/91a0730b3d0442c3c1ddf5f35174fd36.poster.avif?t=1752041971\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277410/extras/91a0730b3d0442c3c1ddf5f35174fd36.webm?t=1752041971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277410/extras/91a0730b3d0442c3c1ddf5f35174fd36.mp4?t=1752041971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your weapon carefully, ammo is limited. Shoot only when you need to. headshots are recommended.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedurally Generated Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items, enemies, room access, clues, and passwords are procedurally generated, so you won\u2019t feel bored in my game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277410/extras/63cbe5e72e713188654337d1a0e0ef9f.poster.avif?t=1752041971\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277410/extras/63cbe5e72e713188654337d1a0e0ef9f.webm?t=1752041971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277410/extras/63cbe5e72e713188654337d1a0e0ef9f.mp4?t=1752041971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles to Solve</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think outside the box and uncover secrets hidden within the asylum. Solve clever puzzles to progress and survive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices Matter</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape the world around you, leading to multiple endings. Will your choices grant you freedom?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
